    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i dont want to reach out to anyone. what's the point? they'll just tell me it gets better or try to \"repair\" me like i'm some kind of broken machine. but it's not a machine. there's just nothing left inside. it's like the damage is too deep for any of that to actually work.",
